WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.295 line:88% align:center
A roadmap is more than bars.

2
00:00:02.345 --> 00:00:05.411 line:88% align:center
Let's add some notes, and make it look like yours.

3
00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:10.011 line:88% align:center
Floating cards are notes that sit over the chart.

4
00:00:10.061 --> 00:00:12.760 line:88% align:center
Drag one to wherever it tells the story best.

5
00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:15.338 line:88% align:center
Each card is pinned to its row.

6
00:00:15.388 --> 00:00:17.850 line:88% align:center
Hide the rows above it and switch to View,

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.944 line:88% align:center
and the card moves up with its row,

8
00:00:19.994 --> 00:00:22.217 line:88% align:center
so it still points at the right thing.

9
00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:27.005 line:88% align:center
There is a second kind of card on the right, good for principles

10
00:00:27.055 --> 00:00:28.027 line:88% align:center
or key messages.

11
00:00:28.077 --> 00:00:30.582 line:88% align:center
Open its tab, and edit a title in place.

12
00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:32.789 line:88% align:center
Not sure about colours?

13
00:00:32.839 --> 00:00:35.932 line:88% align:center
Randomise colours suggests a fresh, matched set.

14
00:00:35.982 --> 00:00:39.534 line:88% align:center
Press it again for another idea, and flip between light

15
00:00:39.584 --> 00:00:41.629 line:88% align:center
and dark to see how it holds up.

16
00:00:42.533 --> 00:00:44.409 line:88% align:center
Rows can be taller or shorter.

17
00:00:44.459 --> 00:00:47.041 line:88% align:center
Choose Compact to fit more on the screen,

18
00:00:47.091 --> 00:00:50.379 line:88% align:center
or a taller row with thicker bars for a simple view.

19
00:00:51.133 --> 00:00:53.355 line:88% align:center
The header comes in several styles.

20
00:00:53.405 --> 00:00:57.184 line:88% align:center
Each is a single slim line, so the roadmap keeps the space.

21
00:00:57.234 --> 00:00:59.910 line:88% align:center
Pick the one that suits your organisation.

22
00:01:00.633 --> 00:01:03.470 line:88% align:center
The rest of the look is in Properties as well.

23
00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:06.670 line:88% align:center
Square or rounded corners, a light or a dark theme,

24
00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:08.239 line:88% align:center
and the fonts you prefer.

